# Where the Vosk/Edge Impulse model files are served from. Leave unset —
# locally that falls back to /models (web/public/models/, gitignored,
# populate it yourself per README.md); on Vercel that same /models path is
# proxied to a GitHub Release via the rewrite in vercel.json, which keeps
# the request same-origin (required for it to work under this site's
# Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy — see the Deploy section in README.md for
# why pointing this straight at github.com breaks that). Only set this if
# you're hosting the models somewhere else entirely.
VITE_MODELS_BASE_URL=
